     1,
     "Hi all,<div><br></div><div>I&#39;ll be giving a backstage tour of ggplot2 in the webinar below (a recorded version will also be available if you can&#39;t make it) - if you want a quick sneak peak at some of the new features in the next version (now scheduled for release March 1), this is an easy way to get it!</div>\n\n<div><br></div><div>Hadley<br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">---------- Forwarded message ----------<br>From: <b class=\"gmail_sendername\">Revolution Analytics</b> <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">in...@revolutionanalytics.com</a>&gt;</span><br>\n\nDate: Tue, Jan 31, 2012 at 10:06 AM<br>Subject: Revolution Webinar Series: Don&#39;t Miss &quot;A Backstage Tour of ggplot2 with Hadley Wickham&quot; Feb 8th<br>To: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">had...@rice.edu</a><br>\n\n<br><br><u></u>\n\n\n\n<div><table style=\"width:100%;background-color:#dfdfdf\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\"><table style=\"text-align:left\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n\n<tbody><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;padding-top:10px\"><table style=\"width:600px\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:#ff6633;vertical-align:top\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n\n<tbody><tr><td><img height=\"21\" width=\"9\" src=\"https://ci4.googleusercontent.com/proxy/AqOcAqEUsg8LiJq7ZN73UdQVgG-44HszRW3u0ie2Qk2apOrg0b5S4v7QpfWMna84vuvRAo7FWIRbZVS7V2HYih04QfDsADmsHSk36dhmS74yTgBEvg=s0-d-e1-ft#https://app.marketo.com/images/public-site/email/cornerNW-grey.png\" alt=\"\"><br></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:middle;text-align:right;color:#ffffff;font-family:Tahoma,Helvetica;font-size:10px;line-height:18px;width:100%\"><div>   </div>\n</td>\n<td><img height=\"21\" width=\"9\" src=\"https://ci4.googleusercontent.com/proxy/LW-PH63FbafJN5p-auCZPSqEJNfNvUphEgPRAKG5RrCS9cTy42lolv0Y22HavyN2mPvYpuMgZ6iGYjAINxnbMWig1N5NLPHR4jbAwqKaoN07hZHu3A=s0-d-e1-ft#https://app.marketo.com/images/public-site/email/cornerNE-grey.png\" alt=\"\"><br></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background-color:#ffffff\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:20px;color:#45555f;font-family:Tahoma,Helvetica;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;vertical-align:top\">\n\n<img src=\"https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/ZioHEKDBqy_p6FrZXUNgJv72NhuBNa5y05eLvSB18UwVNpGqKP4_bijL4lg6yeU6mB-4aFXdvPn891r9vEXnuwM-1xM4CcQfDl6tZSsmRmXxL81izqhszQL5_4qL7Es7AxuwVo5ClpV98DtF=s0-d-e1-ft#http://na-d.marketo.com/rs/revolutioncomputing/images/logo_revolutionanalytics_150x30.gif\" align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"30\" width=\"150\" alt=\"Revolution Analytics\"><div style=\"color:#ff6633;font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;line-height:30px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-left:250px\">\n\n<div>2012 Winter Webinar Series</div>\n</div>\n<br>\n<div style=\"padding:14px\">Hello! Don&#39;t miss &quot;A Backstage Tour of ggplot2 with Hadley Wickham&quot; on February 8th. See below for our full webinar calendar. We hope you&#39;ll be able to attend!</div>\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"650\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#BCBCBC\" height=\"1\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" height=\"29\" valign=\"middle\">\n<div style=\"line-height:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;margin-bottom:0px;color:#424242;margin-left:10px;font-size:16px;font-weight:bold\">Featured Webinar</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#BCBCBC\" height=\"1\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<div><table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:14px;background-color:#f1f1f1;font-size:11px;font-family:Tahoma,Helvetica;color:#45555f\" colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/proxy/1UjCvuKdeHv2MlTOtsoMB1jEHsrRkrewZf32zFjn5tuJssCOCcN3BaKSKW7SQ-_e30sgg3NOoFyvGYHRg2kSBWq9d5bgeQ4qgBtpeqsPO4B9PBSRIP02wO3TKCA2Cw=s0-d-e1-ft#http://www.revolutionanalytics.com/images/speakers/Hadley-Wickham-177px.jpg\" alt=\"Hadley Wickham\" width=\"177\" height=\"185\"></td>\n\n\n<td style=\"padding:14px;background-color:#f1f1f1;font-size:14px;font-family:Tahoma,Helvetica;color:#45555f\" rowspan=\"5\" width=\"392\" valign=\"top\"><strong><a href=\"http://mkto-f0054.com/track?type=click&amp;enid=bWFpbGluZ2lkPXJldm9sdXRpb25jb21wdXRpbmdCZXRhY3VzdC0xOTg2LTQ3MTEtMC05ODgtcHJvZC04MjMmbWVzc2FnZWlkPTAmZGF0YWJhc2VpZD04MjMmc2VyaWFsPTEyNjQ5Nzk0MzMmZW1haWxpZD1oYWRsZXlAcmljZS5lZHUmdXNlcmlkPTUzMTUyNyZleHRyYT0mJiY=&amp;&amp;&amp;http://www.revolutionanalytics.com/news-events/free-webinars/2012/ggplot2-with-hadley-wickham/?mkt_tok=3RkMMJWWfF9wsRonsqTPZKXonjHpfsX96O0oW6Cg38431UFwdcjKPmjr1YoJRNQhcOuuEwcWGog80glOFeyAaIlP9PZSBlGnTDLxhw%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://mkto-f0054.com/track?type%3Dclick%26enid%3DbWFpbGluZ2lkPXJldm9sdXRpb25jb21wdXRpbmdCZXRhY3VzdC0xOTg2LTQ3MTEtMC05ODgtcHJvZC04MjMmbWVzc2FnZWlkPTAmZGF0YWJhc2VpZD04MjMmc2VyaWFsPTEyNjQ5Nzk0MzMmZW1haWxpZD1oYWRsZXlAcmljZS5lZHUmdXNlcmlkPTUzMTUyNyZleHRyYT0mJiY%3D%26%26%26http://www.revolutionanalytics.com/news-events/free-webinars/2012/ggplot2-with-hadley-wickham/?mkt_tok%3D3RkMMJWWfF9wsRonsqTPZKXonjHpfsX96O0oW6Cg38431UFwdcjKPmjr1YoJRNQhcOuuEwcWGog80glOFeyAaIlP9PZSBlGnTDLxhw%253D%253D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792377167223000&amp;usg=AOvVaw01zjwN_-4yAj0oQBY5-Ein\">A Backstage Tour of ggplot2 with Hadley Wickham</a></strong>\n<p>GGplot2 is one of R’s most popular, widely used packages.   It was   developed by Rice University’s Hadley Wickham.    Ggplot2’s   exploratory graphics capabilities are driving the use of R as a   complement to legacy analytics tools such as SAS.    SAS is   well-regarded for its strength in data management and &quot;production&quot;   statistics, where you know what you want to do and need to do it   repeatedly.  On the other hand, R is strong in data analysis and   exploration in situations where figuring out what is needed is the   biggest challenge.  In this important way, SAS and R are strong   companions.</p>\n\n\n<p>This webinar will provide an all-access pass to Hadley’s latest work.  He’ll discuss:</p>\n<ul>\n<li> A brief overview of ggplot2, and how it&#39;s different to other plotting systems</li>\n<li>A sneak peek at some of the new features coming to the next version of ggplot2</li>\n<li>What’s been learned about good development practices in the 5 years since first starting to develop ggplot</li>\n<li>Some of the internals of ggplot2, and talk about how he is gradually making it easier for others to contribute</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Join this webinar to understand how ggplot2 adds valuable, unmatched capabilities to your analytics toolbox.</p>\n<p><span style=\"background-color:#f1f1f1;font-size:11px;font-family:Tahoma,Helvetica;color:#45555f\"><a href=\"http://mkto-f0054.com/track?type=click&amp;enid=bWFpbGluZ2lkPXJldm9sdXRpb25jb21wdXRpbmdCZXRhY3VzdC0xOTg2LTQ3MTEtMC05ODgtcHJvZC04MjMmbWVzc2FnZWlkPTAmZGF0YWJhc2VpZD04MjMmc2VyaWFsPTEyNjQ5Nzk0MzMmZW1haWxpZD1oYWRsZXlAcmljZS5lZHUmdXNlcmlkPTUzMTUyNyZleHRyYT0mJiY=&amp;&amp;&amp;http://info.revolutionanalytics.com/ggplot2-with-hadley-wickham.html?mkt_tok=3RkMMJWWfF9wsRonsqTPZKXonjHpfsX96O0oW6Cg38431UFwdcjKPmjr1YoJRNQhcOuuEwcWGog80glOFeyAaIlP9PZSBlGnTDLxhw%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://mkto-f0054.com/track?type%3Dclick%26enid%3DbWFpbGluZ2lkPXJldm9sdXRpb25jb21wdXRpbmdCZXRhY3VzdC0xOTg2LTQ3MTEtMC05ODgtcHJvZC04MjMmbWVzc2FnZWlkPTAmZGF0YWJhc2VpZD04MjMmc2VyaWFsPTEyNjQ5Nzk0MzMmZW1haWxpZD1oYWRsZXlAcmljZS5lZHUmdXNlcmlkPTUzMTUyNyZleHRyYT0mJiY%3D%26%26%26http://info.revolutionanalytics.com/ggplot2-with-hadley-wickham.html?mkt_tok%